{
"file": 33,
"paths": [
"d002/f645"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "e4d3100b",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "7dd846f7",
"en_raw": "Do you know about the Lizard Hand?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "fa03b799",
"en_raw": "A cursed item from Oahu"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "725eb2f4",
"en_raw": "If you own it, bugs crawl in your ear and you die"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "0931743a",
"en_raw": "...My class is"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "cd6b2fec",
"en_raw": "talking about nothing else"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "e8900423",
"en_raw": "It's silly, but it's nasty"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "1772d3db",
"en_raw": "Sanjo was really angry"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "87a1dc75",
"en_raw": "That's just like her"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "651a4e37",
"en_raw": "But nobody dares put one"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "044cc935",
"en_raw": "in the desk of someone like that"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "ed505ca1",
"en_raw": "...apparently"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "f07a6de1",
"en_raw": "Everyone's a coward"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "7c64cbeb",
"en_raw": "Hey, is this a Santa Claus story?"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "cb117544",
"en_raw": "Huh? Why would it be"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "33eb1f1c",
"en_raw": "Santa Claus in summer?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "2f853bfa",
"en_raw": "Because Kurumi got"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "46bab3b8",
"en_raw": "something nice today"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "fafde6c8",
"en_raw": "Look look, something nice!"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "ee2aa17b",
"en_raw": "Shiina..."
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "6c72f174",
"en_raw": "Is this..."
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "c0ad58f0",
"en_raw": "It's a perfect"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "4cf910aa",
"en_raw": "Lizard Hand, just like the rumor"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "557b5890",
"en_raw": "...What do I do, Sango?"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "d3c70a2d",
"en_raw": "Easy"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "e223da0d",
"en_raw": "Just put it in someone's desk"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "7cd5e841",
"en_raw": "Shiina, tell us who you hate"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "41094c1b",
"en_raw": "Let's go to the classroom!"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "aca8d4e6",
"en_raw": "After six, clubs are over"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "2690ac5e",
"en_raw": "and there are few people, so it's perfect"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "fb9120e1",
"en_raw": "Wait a second, Sango"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "e72db6fd",
"en_raw": "Are you really going to put it in someone's desk?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "1639f2e9",
"en_raw": "If you keep it, you die"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "0f4e5748",
"en_raw": "Throwing it away doesn't work either"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "52f2ead8",
"en_raw": "Then what else"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "c19bb5b4",
"en_raw": "can we do?"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "8bbdd022",
"en_raw": "Hey..."
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "cb393008",
"en_raw": "Why did it come to me?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "46bbf593",
"en_raw": "Who is it? What do I do..."
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "0272a949",
"en_raw": "Nao, you"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "79bfa40b",
"en_raw": "look pretty good with that"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "86f7e307",
"en_raw": "What do I do, what do I do..."
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "c5fe5e9f",
"en_raw": "Oh my,"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "33070e57",
"en_raw": "it fits perfectly..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "f70f2ec5",
"en_raw": "You're more disliked than I thought"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "d79beb42",
"en_raw": "Sango isn't the one it came to!"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "244c4355",
"en_raw": "Well, I"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "22ec4152",
"en_raw": "have no memory"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "7987b44b",
"en_raw": "of anyone disliking me"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "04534a16",
"en_raw": "Nao and Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "e79f2203",
"en_raw": "have matching ones"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "77a0c7cc",
"en_raw": "Though it's not my problem"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "9d9c9214",
"en_raw": "I do sense real malice"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "089b0e26",
"en_raw": "We have no choice but to go back to school"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "9540aeee",
"en_raw": "and track down"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "fba892de",
"en_raw": "whoever put it in"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "db328876",
"en_raw": "How do we do that?"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "4689446b",
"en_raw": "Anyone staying late at school"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "6dd79c89",
"en_raw": "is a suspect"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "470b38ee",
"en_raw": "one after another"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "9fd85a19",
"en_raw": "...Damn it"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "da919645",
"en_raw": "The Toilet Gang, the class rep"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "c426abd9",
"en_raw": "No, it could be Inagaki too"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "fae3124c",
"en_raw": "Aiba Minami glared at us"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "4350f111",
"en_raw": "when she talked with Shiina"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "9fd85a19",
"en_raw": "...Damn it"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "0677ec84",
"en_raw": "I'll never forgive those guys"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "b5ecc3e4",
"en_raw": "What shall we do?"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "57856da1",
"en_raw": "It's obvious!"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "341ce884",
"en_raw": "Drag out whoever put one"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "26f47da8",
"en_raw": "in my desk"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "6f4617db",
"en_raw": "Then face them"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "0444d151",
"en_raw": "and talk it out, slowly"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "05071fbf",
"en_raw": "This is the worst..."
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "48496d58",
"en_raw": "We all have matching ones!"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "3d1eca72",
"en_raw": "Lizard Hands!"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "776b0c4a",
"en_raw": "Anyway, there's only one thing to do"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "681ac08b",
"en_raw": "Go to school and drag out"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "1b10b36b",
"en_raw": "whoever put one in my desk!"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "0e7e6d88",
"en_raw": "From Yuasa to Segawa"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "5228fe01",
"en_raw": "then passed to Nao"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "eba5cbbe",
"en_raw": "One came to me"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "7668d5f3",
"en_raw": "by way of the Toilet Gang"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "2e7ae619",
"en_raw": "And finally, Shiina's..."
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "36e30551",
"en_raw": "Well, there's no point digging"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "b7cd3d40",
"en_raw": "into each of these"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "c97969cc",
"en_raw": "I'm fed up already"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "3db2f2a1",
"en_raw": "Hold on"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "994523c8",
"en_raw": "Doesn't Nao think it's strange?"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "c4df8268",
"en_raw": "Why?"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "692e5016",
"en_raw": "For example, Yuasa"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "f618976e",
"en_raw": "wouldn't need to be so roundabout"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "eb6db0a8",
"en_raw": "to bully Segawa"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "2691a644",
"en_raw": "It'd be easy, right?"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "6583b619",
"en_raw": "Hmm..."
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "bcb85512",
"en_raw": "Honestly, I think the Toilet Gang"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "278d09f2",
"en_raw": "is unlikely to be the source too"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "9ba6675f",
"en_raw": "What do you mean?"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "4d9558d9",
"en_raw": "So far, the culprits we know about"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "fdf4d4fc",
"en_raw": "are all just"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "768f6938",
"en_raw": "one of the victims"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "59eae8dc",
"en_raw": "....."
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "f0d407e6",
"en_raw": "The question isn't who put it in whose desk"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "111a850a",
"en_raw": "is it?"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "bf103696",
"en_raw": "This Lizard Hand..."
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "e13c8c4e",
"en_raw": "and the rumor itself"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "2dd0c976",
"en_raw": "is where they came"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "a5e960fb",
"en_raw": "from in the first place"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "7ff254fa",
"en_raw": "Otherwise, Lizard Hands"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "d0647a39",
"en_raw": "will keep multiplying"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "dad8400e",
"en_raw": "Lizard Hand, Lizard Hand..."
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "c26f1443",
"en_raw": "Where on earth"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "099b60f9",
"en_raw": "did this come from...?"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "3a5efb97",
"en_raw": "To mislead us?"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "d09652a5",
"en_raw": "Either way, it's an"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "6f5202fc",
"en_raw": "outrageously nasty prank"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "058af089",
"en_raw": "No doubt"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "5d88961f",
"en_raw": "This is something that's sold"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "3b6150ff",
"en_raw": "Bad taste, though"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "9e08a5a9",
"en_raw": "Does something like this sell?"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "3898f64d",
"en_raw": "Who knows"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "5cd7f161",
"en_raw": "But if it's sold"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "adf7cfd9",
"en_raw": "there's a place that sells it"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "f3c252d9",
"en_raw": "If we find it and ask"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "0576423e",
"en_raw": "who bought one..."
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "f397db55",
"en_raw": "But where on earth"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "7dfdc8b4",
"en_raw": "do they sell something like this?"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "a3934c7e",
"en_raw": "If only we knew..."
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "0f7297b3",
"en_raw": "But this..."
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "3ba713f7",
"en_raw": "This oddly ethnic craftsmanship"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "ff313617",
"en_raw": "might not be from a normal trinket shop"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "fe0113f5",
"en_raw": "What do you mean?"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "429ec4d6",
"en_raw": "Hey, you"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "16809559",
"en_raw": "use your own head too!"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "26e60451",
"en_raw": "I think"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "fedf0940",
"en_raw": "it looks handmade, so"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "8f1ce0d5",
"en_raw": "probably not sold in a shop"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "229973ae",
"en_raw": "but at a street stall or something"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "d7164264",
"en_raw": "Something like that"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "09e37b63",
"en_raw": "Was there such a place..."
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "80266feb",
"en_raw": "We all have matching ones!"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "23e3bb00",
"en_raw": "Lizard Hands"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "e70ad603",
"en_raw": "Not happy about it at all"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "0023de76",
"en_raw": "Kurumi will buy one"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "880cc788",
"en_raw": "for Kou-kun too"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "d3a4e009",
"en_raw": "You mean to spread misfortune?"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "abe9549a",
"en_raw": "But the shopkeeper also"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "c6efa291",
"en_raw": "said it was a nice thing"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "5e8b6834",
"en_raw": "...The shopkeeper?"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "5f1a85c3",
"en_raw": "Wait, you"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "9f6c0856",
"en_raw": "know where they're sold?"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "27b09e03",
"en_raw": "Yep, that's why"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "10a25c07",
"en_raw": "I'm giving one to Kou-kun too"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "d46c9467",
"en_raw": "Say so sooner, Shiina!"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "52be0408",
"en_raw": "Where's that shop?"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "90bf884f",
"en_raw": "The park, Sango"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "627098ae",
"en_raw": "Shall we go to the park again?"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "561112dd",
"en_raw": "The culprit, whose name is..."
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "0f744db2",
"en_raw": "Kume Kojiro, Class 2-3"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "91148cef",
"en_raw": "I'll talk to him properly"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "255edb5a",
"en_raw": "I get how Sango feels"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "44cf6850",
"en_raw": "but he's still my friend..."
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "c7bf0ac8",
"en_raw": "There are plenty of people who"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "feb214d7",
"en_raw": "lost friends over this"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "ad7bfb21",
"en_raw": "and 'I'll talk to him' settles it?"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "6d17e19a",
"en_raw": "I said I get it, but"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "d38c482b",
"en_raw": "You don't get it at all"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "fc714523",
"en_raw": "...Words are gentle"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "4efdc44b",
"en_raw": "and surprisingly"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "198ef3c9",
"en_raw": "only good for the moment"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "684fd838",
"en_raw": "If you really want him"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "c685765c",
"en_raw": "to reflect as a friend"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "5d28305c",
"en_raw": "that soft attitude"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "94e0e549",
"en_raw": "won't work at all!"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "cbd1040f",
"en_raw": "What should I do?"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "3e0928a4",
"en_raw": "...An eye for an eye, a tooth for a tooth!"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "dc9cdb84",
"en_raw": "Nao, hand over"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "7ccb8f53",
"en_raw": "your Lizard Hand!"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "c793e9ef",
"en_raw": "...You too, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "a6531e0a",
"en_raw": "No, this is Kurumi's!"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "91a6b55b",
"en_raw": "I'll buy you another"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "e5045b2a",
"en_raw": "...Okay"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "41088d18",
"en_raw": "Okay, let's go to school"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "f1cc7f75",
"en_raw": "This is the finale"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "373610d7",
"en_raw": "Well, now we just"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "b0f47178",
"en_raw": "wait for tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "82697e90",
"en_raw": "It feels good"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "5a42886e",
"en_raw": "after doing a good deed!"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "a555f109",
"en_raw": "Kume was frantic this morning"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "0d1f5300",
"en_raw": "He glared at everyone with scary eyes"
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "20260b57",
"en_raw": "Paranoia, serves him right"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "1ae388ef",
"en_raw": "Sango, what did you do?"
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "4d02cd58",
"en_raw": "I left a note"
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "bf3d7a65",
"en_raw": "with the four Lizard Hands"
},
{
"n": 194,
"h": "e0c80a7c",
"en_raw": "...What did you write?"
},
{
"n": 195,
"h": "2af6f902",
"en_raw": "Stop doing gloomy things"
},
{
"n": 196,
"h": "75211de8",
"en_raw": "Idiot!"
},
{
"n": 197,
"h": "d19b1fb7",
"en_raw": "...Using ruler-drawn letters, of course"
},
{
"n": 198,
"h": "cd028ea0",
"en_raw": "That's cruel"
},
{
"n": 199,
"h": "515f5ed5",
"en_raw": "But if we just returned them"
},
{
"n": 200,
"h": "f014db96",
"en_raw": "we couldn't tell him"
},
{
"n": 201,
"h": "05ce604b",
"en_raw": "we knew he was"
},
{
"n": 202,
"h": "b1be85fc",
"en_raw": "the culprit"
},
{
"n": 203,
"h": "f8e1e115",
"en_raw": "Then he'd"
},
{
"n": 204,
"h": "5231473c",
"en_raw": "do the same thing again"
},
{
"n": 205,
"h": "e3539a56",
"en_raw": "for sure"
},
{
"n": 206,
"h": "4b0e3679",
"en_raw": "It's good medicine"
},
{
"n": 207,
"h": "e151bb1c",
"en_raw": "But he's a friend..."
},
{
"n": 208,
